  "objects": [
    {"kind":"standing","x":18,"y":8,"text":["Where a stone stood: a socket in the rock, its edges sharp, no frost in it and no snow.","It is the Old Stone's shape, to a hand's breadth. Down one side of it runs a crack."],"gap":true},
    {"kind":"standing","x":20,"y":9,"text":["Pecked into it, worn almost smooth: a ring of little stones, inside a ring of trees."]},
    {"kind":"standing","x":22,"y":10,"text":["Pecked into it: a stone standing in water, and the water drawn as lines that come and go."]},
    {"kind":"standing","x":23,"y":13,"text":["Pecked into it: a stone by a stream, and little square houses round it."]},
    {"kind":"standing","x":22,"y":15,"text":["Pecked into it, as worn as the rest: something tall and thin with a round top, and lines going out of the top, all one way."]},
    {"kind":"standing","x":20,"y":16,"text":["Pecked into it: four small people on a line, one above the other."]},
    {"kind":"standing","x":18,"y":17,"text":["Pecked into it: a row of crosses, one of them leaning."]},
    {"kind":"standing","x":15,"y":16,"text":["Pecked into it: the same small circle three times, one under the other, and an arrow turning back."]},
    {"kind":"standing","x":13,"y":15,"text":["Pecked into it: two of the same tree, facing each other."]},
    {"kind":"standing","x":12,"y":13,"text":["Pecked into it: tall thin shapes standing round a ring, every one turned the same way."]},
    {"kind":"standing","x":13,"y":10,"text":["Worn smooth. Whatever was on it, the wind took long ago."]},
    {"kind":"standing","x":15,"y":9,"text":["Pecked into it, and fresh, the stone dust still in the cuts: a hand laid flat on a stone."]},
